<title>UK: UK not to refer Entergy bid for London Elec..</title>
<headline>UK not to refer Entergy bid for London Elec..</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK's Department of Trade and Industry said on Monday that it has decided not to refer the acquisition by Entergy Corp of London Electicity Plc to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>U.S. energy group Entergy launched a recommended 1.267 billion stg bid for London Electricity in December 1996.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
